    {
      "page": 5,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "lighting",
      "pageId": "family",
      "title": "A shared section across different uses",
      "body": "Table and floor lights share a linear body, luminous strips and distinctive ends. Support, length and direction change around the use scenario.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/lighting/5beb6f4875965136b4cf16ffcfe6f1fe.webp",
          "caption": "Silver table lamp with a circular base beside an open book on a blue surface"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/lighting/916094a2d9a1fe336ac2d4c9854737b4.webp",
          "caption": "Full view of a silver floor lamp against black"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "lighting",
      "pageId": "materials",
      "title": "Separate material and functional cues",
      "body": "Metal channels, luminous surfaces and circular controls explain different roles. Renderings support comparison of reflection and proportion; optical performance requires testing.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/lighting/e9ab15f955279470fd53cb6e9e9a8c18.webp",
          "caption": "Detail of a gold light body with longitudinal light strips and a circular control"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/lighting/a56bfb9a22490e6fa6dc7073ce8b6f87.webp",
          "caption": "Horizontal pendant with parallel light strips, metal channels and end details against a dark background"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "lighting",
      "pageId": "space",
      "title": "Check the object against the room",
      "body": "Wall recesses and long tables provide scale references. Scenes help compare length, mounting and visual centre in an actual use context.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/lighting/3f7ec7c3d1a16952bb9a0a0c1523be7b.webp",
          "caption": "Gold vertical wall light within a grey architectural recess"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/legacy/lighting/450b32ccc90b8ca88b74c5bbf307c838.webp",
          "caption": "Horizontal linear pendant above a dining table and chairs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 8,
      "kind": "project",
      "case": "huhu-care"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "huhu-care",
      "pageId": "study",
      "title": "Turn a child’s use into form constraints",
      "body": "Sketches and physical models explore grip, mouthpiece position and approachability. Clinical performance and manufacture remain outside the validated scope.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/documents/portfolio-51/023.webp",
          "caption": "Sketches, handmade form models and AIGC exploration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "huhu-care",
      "pageId": "parts",
      "title": "Separate contact, grip and charging",
      "body": "Mouth contact, handheld volume and charging base have different requirements. Their separation makes the relationship between position and action available for review.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/refinement-v2/huhu/mouthpiece.webp",
          "caption": "Mouthpiece and connection"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/refinement-v2/huhu/grip.webp",
          "caption": "Textured grip area"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "huhu-care",
      "pageId": "system",
      "title": "Connect the product and its feedback",
      "body": "The device and base form a use unit. Interface feedback addresses children, carers and clinicians. Models and renderings document the concept stage.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/refinement-v2/huhu/charging-base.webp",
          "caption": "Product and base arrangement"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/documents/portfolio-51/026.webp",
          "caption": "Proposed breath interaction and feedback sequence"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 12,
      "kind": "project",
      "case": "go-glow"
    },
    {
      "page": 13,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "go-glow",
      "pageId": "journey",
      "title": "From travel preparation to maintenance",
      "body": "Carrying, changing modules, cleaning and storage create different tasks. The journey gives the product system concrete design criteria.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/documents/portfolio-51/032.webp",
          "caption": "Packing, use and maintenance journey"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/documents/portfolio-51/033.webp",
          "caption": "Modular personal-care sketches"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 14,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "go-glow",
      "pageId": "modules",
      "title": "Organise the system around use",
      "body": "The handle, replaceable modules and supporting information respond to carrying, switching, cleaning and storage. The diagram analyses original concept evidence.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/media/v7/brand/goglow-logic.webp",
          "caption": "Organise the system around use"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 15,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "go-glow",
      "pageId": "interface",
      "title": "Connect the object and its instructions",
      "body": "The companion interface organises care guidance and module recognition. Naming, colour and hierarchy remain consistent across the product and instructions.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/documents/portfolio-51/035.webp",
          "caption": "Companion-app low- and high-fidelity screens"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/documents/portfolio-51/036.webp",
          "caption": "GO GLOW product-family render"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 16,
      "kind": "project",
      "case": "plumber"
    },
    {
      "page": 17,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "plumber",
      "pageId": "service",
      "title": "Define the roles before the equipment",
      "body": "The service blueprint separates public participation, professional operation and equipment maintenance. Permissions and information flows frame the scanning, transport and return tasks.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/documents/portfolio-51/006.webp",
          "caption": "Storyboard and service-system blueprint"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/documents/portfolio-51/007.webp",
          "caption": "Roles and user journey"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 18,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "plumber",
      "pageId": "assembly",
      "title": "Explain the robot through its parts",
      "body": "Overall and exploded views connect the body, actuators and tail. This concept does not establish sealing, power or pipe-traversal performance.",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/works/refinement-v2/plumber/three-quarter.webp",
          "caption": "Robot three-quarter view"
        },
        {
          "src": "/works/refinement-v2/plumber/exploded.webp",
          "caption": "Robot exploded view"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 19,
      "kind": "evidence",
      "case": "plumber",
      "pageId": "workflow",
      "title": "Connect equipment and interface",
      "body": "The station, device and control interface support parking, execution and monitoring. Their relationship makes it possible to review entry, feedback and recovery.",
